🤖 Popular Embedding Providers

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1️⃣ [OpenAI](https://openai.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com) Embeddings

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

OpenAI provides high-quality embedding models widely used in production RAG systems.

---

🔹 Features

✔ Strong semantic understanding
✔ Excellent multilingual performance
✔ Easy API integration
✔ Production-ready quality

---

💻 Example

```python id="openai_embed"
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(api_key="YOUR_API_KEY")

response = client.embeddings.create(
    model="text-embedding-3-small",
    input="What is machine learning?"
)

embedding = response.data[0].embedding
print(len(embedding))
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

2️⃣ [Cohere](https://cohere.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com) Embeddings

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

Cohere offers powerful embedding models optimized for retrieval and enterprise search.

---

🔹 Features

✔ Strong retrieval performance
✔ Multilingual support
✔ Enterprise-focused APIs

---

💻 Example

```python id="cohere_embed"
import cohere

co = cohere.Client("YOUR_API_KEY")

response = co.embed(
    texts=["What is artificial intelligence?"],
    model="embed-english-v3.0"
)

embedding = response.embeddings[0]
print(len(embedding))
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

3️⃣ [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co?utm_source=chatgpt.com) Embeddings

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Overview

Hugging Face provides many open-source embedding models.

Popular models include:

* sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
* BAAI/bge-small-en
* intfloat/e5-large-v2

---

💻 Example

```python id="hf_embed"
from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer

model = SentenceTransformer("all-MiniLM-L6-v2")

embedding = model.encode("What is deep learning?")
print(len(embedding))
```

